{
    "title": "BitBible (Lockscreen, English)",
    "description": "<b><font color=\"#3fb41d\">One Bible Verse every time you turn on your phone!</font></b>\r\n<b><font color=\"#3fb41d\">The habit of reading God's Word and praying seeping into my life!</font></b>\r\nThere's no need to make grand plans for daily Bible reading and consistent prayer, and there's no need to open a Bible app. It's an app that allows you to read the Bible bit by bit on the lockscreen (first screen) as if it's seeping into your daily life. Do you often check your phone? The more you do, the closer you can get to God by reading the Bible. We create an environment where you can't not read it.\r\n\r\nIf you believe in God, you should read the entire Bible at least once. It is important to go to church, but do not forget to read the Bible and pray. Start right now with 'BitBible' app.\r\n\r\nAnd take the helmet of salvation, and the sword of the Spirit, which is the word of God (Ephesians 6:17)\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#0075c8\">[1. Characteristics and descriptions of \"Bible Reading\" Feature]</font></b>\r\n\u25cf (1) It's very simple! When you turn on your phone, a Bible verse appears. You can see it verse by verse without any burden. (Once you've read a verse, the next verse will be shown automatically.)\r\n\r\n\u25cf (2) Various English Bible versions and the ability to compare them simultaneously are provided. (You can also search for each Bible.)\r\n\r\n\u25cf (3) Various design themes are available. (Night/Sunset/Blue/Mint/Dark Background/Beige)\r\n\r\n<b><font color=\"#0075c8\">[2. Characteristics of \"Faith Delivery\" Feature]</font></b>\r\nThis feature automatically delivers interesting and practical content such as Daily Prayer, Catechism, Quiz at a set time every day. Your spiritual life will be substantially improved.\r\n\r\n\u25cf (1) \ud83d\udcacDaily Reflection (QT)\r\nThrough Daily Bible verses, we help you grasp God's purpose, apply His teachings through reflection, and express gratitude and seek blessings through prayer.\r\n\"Blessed is the one who ~ delights in the law of the Lord and meditates on His law day and night\" (Psalm 1:1-2)\r\n\r\n\u25cf (2) \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffbVarious Prayers\r\nReading the Bible is foundational for walking with God, while prayer strengthens communication, fellowship, and cultivates a God-centered life.\r\nReceive various prayers daily, express various thoughts and requests to God.\r\n\"Pray without ceasing, giving thanks in all circumstances\" (1 Thessalonians 5:17-18)\r\n\r\n\u25cf (3) \ud83e\uddd0Bible Quiz\r\nChapter-end quizzes are provided to assist with recall, reflection, and Bible knowledge, motivating further reading through a sense of accomplishment and interest.\r\n\r\n\u25cf (4) \ud83d\udcd2Bible Book Introduction\r\nProvides purpose, writing dates, and brief summaries for each Bible Book, along with famous paintings illustrating their content, aiding quick comprehension.\r\n\r\n\u25cf (5) \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0fBiblical Paintings\r\nExquisite artwork accompanied by relevant verses and explanation, enhancing understanding and creating a visual connection to the Bible's timeless narratives.\r\n\r\n\u25cf (6) \ud83c\udf3cToday's Flower & Verses\r\nFlowers are one of the creations that contain God's beauty and grace. \r\nEvery day, feel God's beauty and grace, and maintain a positive attitude through daily birth flowers, their language, related verses, and famous quotes provided.\r\n\r\n\u25cf (7) \ud83d\udcdcCatechism\r\nThe catechism, grounded in the Bible, covers key questions on God's nature, salvation's plan, and Christ's role, promoting faith knowledge.\r\nExpand essential knowledge and understanding for faith life by easily obtaining Spirit-filled and authoritative answers to various topics that you might be curious about.\r\n\r\n\u203b More convenient features and contents will be added in the future. If you have a good idea or something that you wish to improve, please let us know by pressing the \"Send Feedback\" button in the app. We will repay you with a better app.\r\n\r\n\u203b Please tell your fellow believers and family about this app, Until it becomes an essential app for Christians to read Bible verses! BitBible!\r\n\r\nNote: Reading the Bible on the \"lock screen\" is the sole purpose of this app, and this app is a \"dedicated lock screen app\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b><font color=\"#3fb41d\">One Bible Verse every time you turn on your phone!</font></b><br><b><font color=\"#3fb41d\">The habit of reading God&#39;s Word and praying seeping into my life!</font></b><br>There&#39;s no need to make grand plans for daily Bible reading and consistent prayer, and there&#39;s no need to open a Bible app. It&#39;s an app that allows you to read the Bible bit by bit on the lockscreen (first screen) as if it&#39;s seeping into your daily life. Do you often check your phone? The more you do, the closer you can get to God by reading the Bible. We create an environment where you can&#39;t not read it.<br><br>If you believe in God, you should read the entire Bible at least once. It is important to go to church, but do not forget to read the Bible and pray. Start right now with &#39;BitBible&#39; app.<br><br>And take the helmet of salvation, and the sword of the Spirit, which is the word of God (Ephesians 6:17)<br><br><b><font color=\"#0075c8\">[1. Characteristics and descriptions of &quot;Bible Reading&quot; Feature]</font></b><br>\u25cf (1) It&#39;s very simple! When you turn on your phone, a Bible verse appears. You can see it verse by verse without any burden. (Once you&#39;ve read a verse, the next verse will be shown automatically.)<br><br>\u25cf (2) Various English Bible versions and the ability to compare them simultaneously are provided. (You can also search for each Bible.)<br><br>\u25cf (3) Various design themes are available. (Night/Sunset/Blue/Mint/Dark Background/Beige)<br><br><b><font color=\"#0075c8\">[2. Characteristics of &quot;Faith Delivery&quot; Feature]</font></b><br>This feature automatically delivers interesting and practical content such as Daily Prayer, Catechism, Quiz at a set time every day. Your spiritual life will be substantially improved.<br><br>\u25cf (1) \ud83d\udcacDaily Reflection (QT)<br>Through Daily Bible verses, we help you grasp God&#39;s purpose, apply His teachings through reflection, and express gratitude and seek blessings through prayer.<br>&quot;Blessed is the one who ~ delights in the law of the Lord and meditates on His law day and night&quot; (Psalm 1:1-2)<br><br>\u25cf (2) \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffbVarious Prayers<br>Reading the Bible is foundational for walking with God, while prayer strengthens communication, fellowship, and cultivates a God-centered life.<br>Receive various prayers daily, express various thoughts and requests to God.<br>&quot;Pray without ceasing, giving thanks in all circumstances&quot; (1 Thessalonians 5:17-18)<br><br>\u25cf (3) \ud83e\uddd0Bible Quiz<br>Chapter-end quizzes are provided to assist with recall, reflection, and Bible knowledge, motivating further reading through a sense of accomplishment and interest.<br><br>\u25cf (4) \ud83d\udcd2Bible Book Introduction<br>Provides purpose, writing dates, and brief summaries for each Bible Book, along with famous paintings illustrating their content, aiding quick comprehension.<br><br>\u25cf (5) \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0fBiblical Paintings<br>Exquisite artwork accompanied by relevant verses and explanation, enhancing understanding and creating a visual connection to the Bible&#39;s timeless narratives.<br><br>\u25cf (6) \ud83c\udf3cToday&#39;s Flower &amp; Verses<br>Flowers are one of the creations that contain God&#39;s beauty and grace. <br>Every day, feel God&#39;s beauty and grace, and maintain a positive attitude through daily birth flowers, their language, related verses, and famous quotes provided.<br><br>\u25cf (7) \ud83d\udcdcCatechism<br>The catechism, grounded in the Bible, covers key questions on God&#39;s nature, salvation&#39;s plan, and Christ&#39;s role, promoting faith knowledge.<br>Expand essential knowledge and understanding for faith life by easily obtaining Spirit-filled and authoritative answers to various topics that you might be curious about.<br><br>\u203b More convenient features and contents will be added in the future. If you have a good idea or something that you wish to improve, please let us know by pressing the &quot;Send Feedback&quot; button in the app. We will repay you with a better app.<br><br>\u203b Please tell your fellow believers and family about this app, Until it becomes an essential app for Christians to read Bible verses! BitBible!<br><br>Note: Reading the Bible on the &quot;lock screen&quot; is the sole purpose of this app, and this app is a &quot;dedicated lock screen app&quot;",
